 {
 	uint32_t ticks = 0;
 
+	/*
+	 * Marks 43-45 separate "the poller never ran" from "the poller ran and
+	 * still saw no traffic". The earlier USB trials only proved that the
+	 * probe path completed; they could not tell whether this thread had
+	 * been scheduled before the missing-launchd panic.
